   281	N = f(z) + sum_{p in Phi^{-1}(z) cap D} mult_p(Phi).               (3.3)
   282	```
   283	
   284	*Proof.*  `Phi^{-1}(z)` is the disjoint union of `F^{-1}(z)` and
