+| K3 refutes the old formula for general smooth-affine étale maps after restricting its domain | **CONFIRMED** | On `S=(C*)^2`, `A_F=V(uv)` and the `u=0` component has `(s,mu,f)=(2,2,0)`. This is a different, broader claim. |
